 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 10.8,
   "end": 13.3,
   "text": "Honey, I told you something"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.5,
   "end": 15.8,
   "text": "Sorry, I didn't hear"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.0,
   "end": 18.4,
   "text": "Maybe there was something"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.4,
   "end": 20.9,
   "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, stuck in your ear"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.4,
   "end": 26.0,
   "text": "Why is it every time you say you do, you don't?"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.8,
   "end": 32.2,
   "text": "Maybe I just thought that you were talking on the phone"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.6,
   "end": 36.2,
   "text": "Honey, you're looking lovely tonight"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.3,
   "end": 38.7,
   "text": "Sorry, you're wasting time"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.8,
   "end": 41.3,
   "text": "Baby, this ain't your lucky night"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.3,
   "end": 43.8,
   "text": "Well, trying ain't a crime"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.2,
   "end": 48.8,
   "text": "Why is it every time I like to do, you don't?"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.5,
   "end": 54.8,
   "text": "Maybe you could try a little romance and a comb"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.0,
   "end": 58.6,
   "text": "Let's go back in time"
  },
  {
   "start": 58.7,
   "end": 65.6,
   "text": "Way back when we were la la la la la la la la la"
  },
  {
   "start": 65.7,
   "end": 72.5,
   "text": "Now it's married life, and the daily strife should be"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.5,
   "end": 82.5,
   "text": "la la la la la la la, la la la la la la la, la, la la la la la la, la, la la la"
  },
  {
   "start": 86.1,
   "end": 88.7,
   "text": "Honey, you're getting older"
  },
  {
   "start": 88.8,
   "end": 91.2,
   "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, you're twenty-nine"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.3,
   "end": 93.8,
   "text": "And maybe things are colder"
  },
  {
   "start": 93.8,
   "end": 96.3,
   "text": "But honey, still you're mine"
  },
  {
   "start": 96.8,
   "end": 101.3,
   "text": "Guess it's easy to forget we're more than man and wife"
  },
  {
   "start": 101.9,
   "end": 107.5,
   "text": "Could it be the la-la magic keeping love alive?"
  },
  {
   "start": 107.7,
   "end": 111.3,
   "text": "Let's go back in time"
  },
  {
   "start": 111.4,
   "end": 118.3,
   "text": "Way back when we were la la la la la la la la la"
  },
  {
   "start": 118.4,
   "end": 125.2,
   "text": "Back when you and I still had time to be"
  },
